sidue. Has a preference for galactose-beta-1,4-xylose that is found in the linker region of glycosaminoglycans, such as heparan sulfate and chondroitin sulfate. Has no activity towards substrates with terminal glucosamine or galactosamine residues."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}